# Architecture & TypeScript Core

## Dependency Rule

```
{module}/presentation → {module}/application → {module}/domain
{module}/infrastructure → {module}/domain
common may be used by all modules; modules must not depend on common/presentation from domain
prefer cross-module calls via application; avoid presentation ↔ presentation sprawl
```

**Domain has NO dependencies on other layers or frameworks (no React / Next.js).**

## Terminology Index (Hexagonal ↔ This Project)

| Hexagonal concept | Hexagonal layout | This project | Path pattern |
|-------------------|------------------|--------------|--------------|
| Driving adapter | `adapter/in` | Module presentation + application | `src/{module}/presentation/`, `application/` |
| Driven adapter | `adapter/out` | Module / common infrastructure | `src/{module}/infrastructure/`, `src/common/infrastructure/` |
| Outbound port | `domain/port` | Domain service / repository interface | `src/{module}/domain/` |
| Domain core | `domain` | Module domain | `src/{module}/domain/` |
| Composition / UI shell | — | Next.js App Router | `src/app/` |

## Forbidden in New Code

- Global layer roots: `src/domain/`, `src/application/`, `src/presentation/`, `src/shared/`
- `domain/port/` — prefer domain services / repository interfaces under `{module}/domain/`
- `*Port` interface suffix — prefer `*Repository`, `*Service`, or a domain-specific name
- `adapter/in` / `adapter/out` packages — use `{module}/{layer}/`

## Business Modules

| Module | Path | Owns |
|--------|------|------|
| `canvas` | `src/canvas/` | Canvas UI, properties panel, canvas store / hooks |
| `component` | `src/component/` | Component types, factory, management, panel / renderer, component stores |
| `template` | `src/template/` | Gallery, template command, template data |
| `theme` | `src/theme/` | Theme store / editor, animation editor |
| `data` | `src/data/` | Data source / binding services, data store, data panel |
| `chart` | `src/chart/` | Chart components + chart renderer |
| `form` | `src/form/` | Form builder + form renderer |
| `export` | `src/export/` | Code export UI |
| `collaboration` | `src/collaboration/` | Collaboration UI |
| `common` | `src/common/` | UI kit, `cn`/utils, persistence, history, cross-cutting hooks |

## Layers (inside each module)

| Layer | Contains |
|-------|----------|
| `domain/` | Types, entities, domain services |
| `application/` | Use-case / application services |
| `infrastructure/` | Zustand stores, adapters, LocalStorage helpers |
| `presentation/` | React UI for that module |

## Project Structure

```
src/
├── app/                 # Next.js App Router shell
├── canvas|component|template|theme|data|chart|form|export|collaboration/
│   ├── domain/
│   ├── application/
│   ├── infrastructure/
│   └── presentation/
└── common/
    ├── domain/
    ├── application/
    ├── infrastructure/
    └── presentation/    # shadcn / Radix primitives + shell chrome
```

## Domain Rules

- No React / Next.js imports in `{module}/domain/`
- Prefer rich behavior in domain services over anemic bags of fields
- Keep Preferred Terms aligned with [docs/Glossary.md](../../docs/Glossary.md)

## TypeScript Naming

| Type | Rule | Example |
|------|------|---------|
| Component | PascalCase | `ComponentPanel` |
| Store | camelCase + Store | `componentStore` / `useComponentStore` |
| Service | PascalCase + Service | `ComponentManagementService` |
| Types / interfaces | PascalCase | `ThemeConfig` |
| Methods / vars | camelCase | `findById` |
| Constants | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | `MAX_HISTORY` |
| Files | kebab-case | `component-panel.tsx` |

## Test Naming

`should_expected_when_condition` (or Vitest `it("should ...")` matching the same intent).

